Counter:
./pptest 3 -c 1 -v 42 -check -pll 1M-100M

Generate pseudo-random numbers using xoroshiro128++:
./pptest 19 -c 0 -pll 1M-100M

Generate one pulse on qout[0]:
./pptest 2 -c 1000 -v 1 -t 0 -veryverbose

Test of PB trigger (push right button):
./pptest 12 -check -veryverbose -trig_std -c 100 -pll 10M-100M

Verbose checks:
./pptest 10 -v 8 -c 10000 -repetitions 7 -nr_replays 4 -check -veryverbose -verbosecheck

Trigger delay:
./pptest 10 -v 8 -c 10000 -repetitions 10 -nr_replays 10 -check -verbosecheck -veryverbose -post -o 2 -mid -m 2 -delay 3.0 -sep

./pptest 3 -v 15 -veryverbose -pll 10M-100M -check
